//! How work with each typical skill is described in words: by a person in a job description
//! (`work`) and by a vacancy (`ask`), mostly without naming the technology the way the other side
//! does. Synthetic texts of the matching validation (`crates/validate`) and of the demo seed are
//! written from these phrases; nothing in matching itself reads them.

/// How a candidate describes doing it (`work`) and how a vacancy asks for it (`ask`).
pub struct SkillText {
    pub slug: &'static str,
    pub work: &'static [&'static str],
    pub ask: &'static [&'static str],
}

